     The recover utility should be able to rebuild a save file at the
point where you descended the stairs with no problem, provided
that you left the checkpoint option enabled.  But there's nothing
other than chance to prevent whatever action triggered the segfault
from taking place again.  And if the problem is being triggered by
monster-death-upon-your-arrival then you're pretty much stuck,
even if the tournament has earlier backups available (unless
they're from prior to the genociding).



